  Place FightcadeRewindPlayer.exe into your Fightcade root directory
  (the folder containing the 'emulator' directory, e.g.,
  C:\Users\<Username>\Documents\Fightcade\ or your custom path).

[2. How to Use]
  Step 1: Copy any Fightcade replay link
          (e.g., https://replay.fightcade.com/fbneo/garou/...)
  Step 2: Launch FightcadeRewindPlayer.exe (URL auto-detected).
  Step 3: Click 'Launch Replay' to start watching!

[3. Director Remote Controls]
  ⚡ Probe to EOF : Fast forward to match end and unlock percentage bar.
  PCT Buttons     : Jump directly to 0% ~ 90% of the match instantly.
  ⏪ ⏩ Rewind    : Step back/forward by 3s, 10s, 30s with zero desync.
  Play / Pause    : Freeze video cleanly without desync; resume smoothly.
  -1f / +1f       : Frame-by-frame step to inspect hitboxes and combos.

[4. Why is 'Probe to EOF' Needed Before Free Seeking? (Tech Info)]
  Fightcade replays are not pre-rendered videos (like MP4); they are
  live game input packet streams. At the start, the emulator only has
  the first few seconds of input data.
  By clicking '⚡ Probe to EOF', the player runs at a safe 600 FPS in the
  background to buffer all inputs and index clean snapshots. Once the total
  duration is locked, the timeline and percentage buttons are fully unlocked!

[5. Platform Compatibility Notice]
  Currently, this core has been reverse-engineered and verified primarily
  on Neo-Geo's Garou: Mark of the Wolves. Other games or different hardware
  drivers (CPS1, CPS2, CPS3, etc.) are not yet guaranteed to be compatible.

[6. Clean & Safe Design]
  * Fully portable single executable; all components are embedded.
  * Automatically backs up official DLL on launch.
  * Automatically restores original DLL on exit or clicking restore,
    leaving zero residue and not affecting online matches at all!

